+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+// Emulation vs. Silicon Behaviour
+// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
+/// Barrier strength for the aarch64 TLB / address-space paths
+/// (hal/io_impl.hpp: tlbi_aside1, tlbi_alle1, write_cr3).
+///   1 = QEMU/TCG-safe: emit `dmb sy` (default; the only path every QEMU
+///       gate exercises).
